    {
      "sha": "b616d37557a26f2f97a22bc97251ba43350d2c6f",
      "short_sha": "b616d37",
      "message": "feat: add forward-zoom Galaxy canvas background to home\n\n- New Galaxy.tsx React component: Canvas-based 3-layer starfield\n  (far/mid/near), 470 stars total, perspective projection\n- Recursive z-depth: stars spawn at z=1 (far) and approach z=0\n  (near), recycle on pass — simulates flying through space\n- Color palette includes white dwarfs, blue, yellow, orange giants\n- Soft radial nebula glow (purple/blue) at center\n- Glow halos when stars get close to camera\n- Mouse parallax (3 layers at different strength) + deviceorientation\n- Honors prefers-reduced-motion (static frame, no animation)\n- Vignette + subtle radial darkening at edges\n- Only loaded on home page (client:only='react'), no global JS cost\n- Total bundle: 3.3 KB raw / ~1.4 KB gzip",
      "author": {
        "name": "KBber",
        "email": "kbber@example.com"
      },
      "date": "2026-09-05T04:07:49Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/KBber/KBber.github.io/commit/b616d37557a26f2f97a22bc97251ba43350d2c6f"
    },
    {
      "sha": "3f2e8fb8672d126820b7fe29a8f2a6b45d64c725",
      "short_sha": "3f2e8fb",
      "message": "feat: rebuild blog with Astro + React (Liquid Glass, dark/light, content collections)\n\n- Astro 5 + React 19 + TypeScript\n- Liquid glass navbar with backdrop-filter, dark/light theme toggle\n- Live clock + greeting + IP-based weather (Open-Meteo, no key needed)\n- Draggable magnetic cards (vanilla pointer events)\n- Pages: Home, Posts, Albums, Moments, Notes, About\n- Content collections (Markdown + JSON)\n- Lightbox photo viewer, reading progress bar\n- RSS + sitemap\n- GitHub Actions auto-deploy to gh-pages",
      "author": {
        "name": "KBber",
        "email": "kbber@example.com"
      },
      "date": "2026-09-05T03:58:01Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/KBber/KBber.github.io/commit/3f2e8fb8672d126820b7fe29a8f2a6b45d64c725"
